# Communication To Ngrok Tunneling Service Initiated | T1090, T1102, T1567, T1568.002, T1572 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/network_connection/net_connection_win_domain_ngrok_tunnel.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=3 (DestinationHostname IN ("*tunnel.us.ngrok.com*", "*tunnel.eu.ngrok.com*", "*tunnel.ap.ngrok.com*", "*tunnel.au.ngrok.com*", "*tunnel.sa.ngrok.com*", "*tunnel.jp.ngrok.com*", "*tunnel.in.ngrok.com*"))
